      "text": "\n\nSubject: Update on your export request\n\nHi [Name],\n\nI am writing to let you know that the export feature you requested will be delivered one week later than originally scheduled.\n\nDuring our final validation phase, we identified a data-integrity issue that could have caused discrepancies in the exported records. We stopped the release to ensure that the data you receive is accurate and complete. We take full responsibility for this oversight, and we are prioritizing the fix.\n\n**What is being done:**\nOur engineering team is currently implementing a patch to resolve the integrity check. We are running a full regression test suite to verify that the fix works across all data types before we proceed.\n\n**What to expect next:**\nWe expect to complete testing and deploy the feature by [Date, one week from now]. We will send a separate confirmation email as soon as the feature is live.\n\n**For urgent cases:**\nIf you have a time-sensitive export that cannot wait for the scheduled release, please reply to this email or contact our support team directly. We can manually process your export request and deliver the data to you within 24 hours.\n\nWe apologize for the delay and appreciate your patience while we ensure the quality of this feature.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title]\n[Company Name]",
